                - paragraph: If the current capacity is less than the lower limit, this is a no-op.
                - heading "Examples" [level=5] [ref=f84e1732]
                - code: let mut vec = Vec::with_capacity(10); vec.extend([1, 2, 3]); assert!(vec.capacity() >= 10); vec.shrink_to(4); assert!(vec.capacity() >= 4); vec.shrink_to(0); assert!(vec.capacity() >= 3);
