              - generic:
                - paragraph:
                  - text: Shortens the vector, keeping the first
                  - code: len
                  - text: elements and dropping the rest.
                - paragraph:
                  - text: If
                  - code: len
                  - text: is greater or equal to the vector’s current length, this has no effect.
                - paragraph:
                  - text: The
                  - link [ref=f84e1863]:
                    - /url: struct.Vec.html#method.drain
