                - text: .
              - heading "Safety" [level=5] [ref=f84e3423]
              - paragraph:
                - text: Calling this method with an out-of-bounds index is
                - emphasis:
                  - link "undefined behavior" [ref=f84e3426]
                - text: even if the resulting reference is not used.
              - paragraph:
                - text: You can think of this like
                - code: .get_mut(index).unwrap_unchecked()
                - text: . It’s UB to call
                - code: .get_unchecked_mut(len)
