                  - link "Vec" [ref=f84e7569]
                  - text: <
                  - link "u8" [ref=f84e7570]
                  - text: ">"
                - text: .
              - paragraph:
                - text: The conversion consumes the
                - link [ref=f84e7572]:
                  - code: CString
                - text: ", and removes the terminating NUL byte."
