                - link [ref=f84e7633]:
                  - code: String
                - text: to a vector
                - link [ref=f84e7635]:
                  - code: Vec
                - text: that holds values of type
                - link [ref=f84e7637]:
                  - code: u8
                - text: .
              - heading "Examples" [level=5] [ref=f84e7639]
              - code: "let s1 = String::from(\"hello world\"); let v1 = Vec::from(s1); for b in v1 { println!(\"{b}\"); }"
