                  - text: Attempts to convert a
                  - code: Vec<T>
                  - text: into a
                  - code: Box<[T; N]>
                  - text: .
                - paragraph:
                  - text: Like
                  - link [ref=f84e8999]:
                    - code: Vec::into_boxed_slice
                  - text: ", this is in-place if"
                  - code: vec.capacity() == N
                  - text: ", but will require a reallocation otherwise."
                - heading "Errors" [level=5] [ref=f84e9002]
                - paragraph:
                  - text: Returns the original
                  - code: Vec<T>
                  - text: in the
                  - code: Err
                  - text: variant if
                  - code: boxed_slice.len()
                  - text: does not equal
                  - code: "N"
                  - text: .
                - heading "Examples" [level=5] [ref=f84e9008]
                - paragraph:
                  - text: This can be used with
                  - link [ref=f84e9010]:
                    - code: vec!
                  - text: "to create an array on the heap:"
                - code: "let state: Box<[f32; 100]> = vec![1.0; 100].try_into().unwrap(); assert_eq!(state.len(), 100);"
